sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Reference lab
  participant C as Clinic
  participant G as HL7 Edge Gateway
  participant M as MEDITECH
  L->>G: POST /hl7/results (X-API-Key, ORU^R01 REF-3001)
  G->>G: check the key, store
  G-->>L: 200 {"ack_code":"AA"}
  G->>M: REF-3001 (MLLP :6661)
  M-->>G: ACK AA (filed)
  L->>G: POST /hl7/results (no key)
  G-->>L: 401 (not stored)
  C->>G: POST /Hl7Service (basic auth, SOAP with ADT^A04)
  G->>M: ADT^A04 (MLLP :6662)
  M-->>G: ACK AR "patient not found"
  G-->>C: 200 SOAP response with MEDITECH's AR
